    "warnings": [
      "Dungeon min 50 so runAt 53, cap 60.",
      "Long Atal'ai tablet chain (1424→1429→1444→1445) and Jammal'an (1446 via the same Exile) are optional — drop them instead of a Hinterlands detour. 1424 and 1429 are owned by the 40-60 route.",
      "Yeh'kinya / God Hakkar chain (3520→3527 ZF→4787 Jintha'Alor→3528) is optional. Do not add Zul'Farrak just for 3528.",
      "Marvon chain (3380 Camp Mojache→3444 Ratchet chest→3446/3447) and Zapper Fuel (4145 Un'Goro→4147→4146) are optional out-of-zone sets.",
      "Class Morphaz/voodoo-feather quests are optional; show only for that class. Do not reset for a second Morphaz.",
      "Kill XP inside dungeons is increased; if any party member would get no XP because mobs are trivial, nobody gets XP (Forever hotfix)."
