  "notes": "Classic Temple of Atal'Hakkar, Horde only. Pickup Stonard / Un'Goro / Orgrimmar around 48-52. Dungeon min 50 so runAt 53 (max(50+3, 53)), cap 60. 39 catalog quests. Long Atal'ai tablet (1424→1429→1444→1445), Yeh'kinya (3520→3527→4787→3528), and Jammal'an (1446 via the Exile) chains are listed in order and marked optional so the planner can drop them instead of adding Hinterlands/ZF detours. Dungeons off: Felwood, Un'Goro, Azshara. Classic XP; Forever live XP unverified."
